body:
Simplified the definition of `IndexType` and `SizeType` in order to add CTAD support to `ImageRegion`. Added a deduction guide, to avoid compiler warnings.

Supports declaring a region, without explicitly specifying its dimension, e.g.:

    itk::ImageRegion region(index, size);

